{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;No matter how strong or young you are now, one day you're gonna be old, weak, and sick... Who's gonna take care of you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some people prefer death rather than to be in this situation... The idea of dying can be scary... What happens after? If you lived a life of wrong decisions, maybe you don't want to know. Maybe you would even do anything to delay that moment as much as you can... but it always comes...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a linear short horror experience for gamers who enjoy unsettling and crazy horror narratives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One-third of this game was released three years ago. Now, it's coming to Steam with a lot more content and improvements. If you played the older version, you'll find plenty of new things in this one, it's even scarier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world and interact with unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make choices that shape the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles and run for your life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game\u2019s story is the centerpiece, it drives the entire experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Around 1 hour of gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>For the best experience, play alone, in a dark room, with headphones.</strong></u></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815470?t=1751893912","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815470/d53a973dee02f47c3908596a11aa287e32b92c9a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751893912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps